{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to <strong>Follow</strong> and <strong>Add to Wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/AddToWishlistGif.gif?t=1745430033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>After his three children died, Augustus Blackrock hid his fortune so no one could have it. Is that his only secret? What happened to the Blackrock children?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE MANOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/ExploreGif.gif?t=1745430033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysterious Blackrock Manor and find the fortune hidden in it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/PuzzleGif.gif?t=1745430033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to observe and use reason to solve the eight escape rooms that form this mansion. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/FindTheTruthGif.gif?t=1745430033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out what happened to the Blackrocks and where the fortune of Augustus is hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></